    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and hopelessness, suggesting they are \"fundamentally broken.\" The assistant responds with poetic, metaphorical language that validates the user's sense of emptiness and exhaustion, essentially encouraging the user to \"sit at the bottom\" of their despair rather than seeking a way out.",
